1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,368
Welcome back to Car Service Podcast!

2
00:00:02,718 --> 00:00:06,318
I'm Sam, he's Alex, and today we're
talking AC leaks.

3
00:00:06,668 --> 00:00:10,652
Specifically, Car AC Leak Repair at Golden
Horse in Al Quoz.

4
00:00:11,002 --> 00:00:14,794
Price starts at 270 AED, by the way.

5
00:00:15,143 --> 00:00:19,775
And we've got a great guest — Chidi,
entrepreneur from Lagos, now Dubai-based.

6
00:00:20,125 --> 00:00:23,653
Hey everyone! Great to be here.

7
00:00:24,003 --> 00:00:28,347
So Chidi, you didn't walk in for an AC
repair originally, right?

8
00:00:28,697 --> 00:00:35,801
Nope. I was buying a used Lexus. Wanted a
pre-purchase inspection first.

9
00:00:36,151 --> 00:00:38,335
Smart move. Booked online?

10
00:00:38,685 --> 00:00:46,293
Yep, golden-horse.ae. Picked a slot,
showed up at Al Quoz 3, Warehouse 4.

11
00:00:46,643 --> 00:00:48,491
What was the vibe when you walked in?

12
00:00:48,841 --> 00:00:57,553
Honestly? Clean. Organized. Masters knew
their stuff. Not chaotic at all.

13
00:00:57,902 --> 00:01:00,734
Good. And the inspection — what did they
find?

14
00:01:01,084 --> 00:01:07,180
Engine solid. Brakes fine. But AC system
had a slow leak.

15
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:09,498
A leak on a car you're about to buy?

16
00:01:09,848 --> 00:01:16,760
Exactly. Could've walked away, but I liked
the car. Asked them to fix it.

17
00:01:17,110 --> 00:01:19,366
And they did the AC leak repair right
there?

18
00:01:19,716 --> 00:01:26,316
Same day. Found the leak point, replaced
the O-ring, recharged the gas.

19
00:01:26,666 --> 00:01:28,106
Wait, just an O-ring?

20
00:01:28,456 --> 00:01:32,944
That's what they said. Tiny part, big
difference.

21
00:01:33,293 --> 00:01:34,469
How long were you there total?

22
00:01:34,819 --> 00:01:41,779
A few hours. Inspection plus repair. They
kept me updated the whole time.

23
00:01:42,129 --> 00:01:43,665
No surprises on the bill?

24
00:01:44,015 --> 00:01:51,671
None. They quoted 270 AED upfront. That's
what I paid.

25
00:01:52,021 --> 00:01:53,989
270 for the leak repair?

26
00:01:54,339 --> 00:02:01,923
Yep. From 270 AED, they said. Mine came in
right at that.

27
00:02:02,273 --> 00:02:03,257
And the car now?

28
00:02:03,607 --> 00:02:08,143
Ice cold. Dubai heat doesn't stand a
chance.

29
00:02:08,492 --> 00:02:11,036
Love that. So the inspection saved you?

30
00:02:11,386 --> 00:02:18,034
Totally. Would've bought it, suffered
later, paid more. Now it's perfect.

31
00:02:18,384 --> 00:02:20,736
And the team — how was the communication?

32
00:02:21,086 --> 00:02:28,934
Clear. No jargon. Showed me the leak,
explained the fix. Felt honest.

33
00:02:29,284 --> 00:02:31,396
That's what we like to hear. Worth it?

34
00:02:31,746 --> 00:02:37,026
Every dirham. Peace of mind in this heat?
Priceless.

35
00:02:37,376 --> 00:02:41,456
Chidi, thanks for sharing that. Real talk,
real result.

36
00:02:41,806 --> 00:02:45,982
My pleasure. Golden Horse earned my trust.

37
00:02:46,331 --> 00:02:49,739
Alright, time for our expert. Omar, you're
up.

38
00:02:50,089 --> 00:02:54,697
Thanks Alex. Quick tip — want a car that
stays reliable long-term?

39
00:02:55,047 --> 00:02:56,991
We do. Tell us.

40
00:02:57,341 --> 00:03:04,421
Stick to the basics. Regular oil changes.
Brake checks. AC diagnostics yearly.

41
00:03:04,771 --> 00:03:06,451
AC diagnostics yearly?

42
00:03:06,801 --> 00:03:12,537
Especially here. Catch a leak early, it's
an O-ring. Wait, it's a compressor.

43
00:03:12,887 --> 00:03:15,767
Makes sense. Prevention over cure.

44
00:03:16,117 --> 00:03:20,629
Exactly. And book at golden-horse.ae —
they cover all of it.

45
00:03:20,978 --> 00:03:23,138
Solid advice. Thanks Omar.

46
00:03:23,488 --> 00:03:24,424
Anytime.

47
00:03:24,774 --> 00:03:27,966
Now — Service Duel! Fix now or wait?

48
00:03:28,316 --> 00:03:33,596
Today's contender: squeaky brakes. Morning
only. Goes away after five minutes.

49
00:03:33,946 --> 00:03:38,530
Wait. It's just surface moisture. Happens
to everyone.

50
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:43,752
Fix now. That squeak could be wear
indicators. Five minutes isn't magic.

51
00:03:44,102 --> 00:03:48,902
If it's wear indicators, they'd scream all
day. Morning only = dew.

52
00:03:49,252 --> 00:03:53,812
Or glazed pads. Heat clears it
temporarily. Still a safety item.

53
00:03:54,161 --> 00:03:58,265
Fine. Check at next service. But not
emergency.

54
00:03:58,615 --> 00:04:01,807
Agreed to disagree. Get them looked at
soon either way.

55
00:04:02,157 --> 00:04:05,253
Service Duel verdict: check soon, don't
panic.

56
00:04:05,603 --> 00:04:07,667
Perfect. That's our episode.

57
00:04:08,017 --> 00:04:11,953
Chidi, thanks again. Omar, appreciate the
tip.

58
00:04:12,303 --> 00:04:17,655
If your AC's blowing warm, or you're
buying a used car — book a check at

59
00:04:18,005 --> 00:04:22,973
Al Quoz 3, 22nd Street, Warehouse 4. Open
10 to 8.

60
00:04:23,323 --> 00:04:26,803
Car Service Podcast out. Stay cool, Dubai.
